{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not turn MDC snapshot failures into terminal workflow failures.** Every nonempty plugin configuration now performs this optional logging operation before hooks or user code, and an ordinary adapter failure is routed through `finishFailure`, emitting durable `FAILED`. Treat capture as best-effort with a safe baseline, or propagate an invocation-level retry without writing a terminal failure.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77xMzu","finding_digest":"0133ad3d67132cc709d324b4bff21ae1d7ecb80233125efebfc5cabeb0237650","finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","line":279,"observation_digest":"bdf3f6f4360bc87ff0d7d4c450255359d7fcec1410738cfdce3d7d4ba2777d88","observation_id":"aro_v1_xxz7n5bwbpeh74gx2tcfajktlh","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","published_at":"2026-10-08T20:48:08Z","review_id":"arr_v1_x7jz3p7qev5bxz3oyirpg4lplp","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"b882ea7c57a688d35a0eb694629d494a98769c57","reviewer":"codex","start_line":279,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_gju6ubl4ix5ohemrd5lnm74jea","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T20:48:08Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
